# This repository holds the website only. Everything at the top level is
# ignored by default and the site's own files are listed back in below, so the
# videos, zips, backups, render outputs and the separate apps that share this
# folder never get committed by accident.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/index.html
!/index.template.html
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/vite.config.js
!/.github/
!/src/
!/public/
!/scripts/
!/data-src/
!/tools/

# build output, dependencies and local clutter (anywhere in the tree)
node_modules/
dist/
.DS_Store
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
